                "headline": "Rip Current Statement issued October 17 at 3:40AM EDT until October 20 at 2:00AM EDT by NWS Miami FL",
                "description": "* WHAT...Dangerous rip currents expected.\n\n* WHERE...Coastal Palm Beach County, Coastal Broward County and\nCoastal Miami Dade County.\n\n* WHEN...From late tonight through late Monday night.\n\n* IMPACTS...Rip currents can sweep even the best swimmers away\nfrom shore into deeper water.",
